# Unity World Model Rules

Main demo scene: `Assets/Scenes/WorldModelPlannerRoom.unity`.

Core AI files live in `Assets/Scripts/ML/`. Keep the demo stable: AI toggle,
Brain HUD, action ranking, imagined futures, and metrics should remain visible
after AI changes.

For Python world-model changes, run:

```powershell
python -m py_compile tools/world_model/train_world_model.py
python tools/world_model/train_world_model.py --smoke --epochs 2
```
